          "overview": "## Atlassian MCP Server\n\nThe Atlassian MCP server lets AI assistants work directly with Atlassian Cloud and Server/Data Center products from within an AI-driven workflow. It provides programmatic access to Jira, Confluence, and related Atlassian resources so users can search, create, and update content without switching tools.",
